# Test configuration for thorn TargetTracker
#
# The reference data files are CarpetIOASCII output (extension 'asc'); the
# header comment lines (dates, build IDs, ...) are ignored by the test
# comparison, only the data columns are compared.

EXTENSIONS asc

RELTOL 1e-10
ABSTOL 1e-12

# Self-validating checks for the volume-restriction identities, only for the
# test that sets up the relevant targets (pattern is matched against the file
# path, so it is scoped to that test's output directory).
POSTPROC check_restriction com_restrict_identity.*target_com
